  "user_prompt": "Design a focused analog library of 5 compounds based on Chlorambucil (SMILES: OC(=O)CCCc1ccc(N(CCCl)CCCl)cc1) with systematic modifications at key positions to explore SAR against DNA alkylation. Include SMILES for each analog.\n\nRespond ONLY with JSON in this exact format:\n{\"modifications\": [{\"description\": \"analog 1 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_1\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 1\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 2 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_2\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 2\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 3 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_3\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 3\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 4 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_4\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 4\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 5 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_5\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 5\"}]}",
  "raw_response": "```json\n{\n  \"modifications\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Replace the carboxylic acid group with a sulfonic acid group to increase hydrophilicity.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"OS(=O)(=O)CCCc1ccc(N(CCCl)CCCl)cc1\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Increased hydrophilicity may enhance water solubility and potentially alter DNA binding affinity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Introduce a methyl group on the aromatic ring para to the nitrogen group.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"OC(=O)CCCc1ccc(N(CCCl)CCCl)c(C)c1\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Adding a methyl group could influence electron distribution, impacting DNA alkylation activity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Substitute one chloroethyl group with a hydroxyethyl group on the nitrogen atom.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"OC(=O)CCCc1ccc(N(CCCl)C(CO))cc1\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Replacing a chloroethyl group with hydroxyethyl may modulate reactivity and reduce off-target alkylation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add a fluorine atom ortho to the nitrogen-containing group on the aromatic ring.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"OC(=O)CCCc1cc(F)c(N(CCCl)CCCl)cc1\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Fluorine substitution might alter electronic properties, potentially affecting DNA binding specificity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Expand the alkyl chain linking the carboxylic acid to the aromatic ring by one methylene group.\",\n      \"smiles\": \"OC(=O)CCCCc1ccc(N(CCCl)CCCl)cc1\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Increasing the linker length may influence the molecule's spatial interaction with DNA.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
